# Root DECISIONS.md PLATFORM-GAP-002: MigrationRunnerService's checksum
# (D16) is a plain sha256 over a migration file's raw contents, so its
# line endings are part of the hash. Without this file, Windows checkouts
# (core.autocrlf=true, the Git-for-Windows default) silently convert every
# *.sql file to CRLF, which flips its checksum relative to whatever was
# recorded in module_migrations the first time that file was applied —
# tripping the "already-applied migration must never be edited" guard on
# a file nobody actually edited. Pin every migration to LF unconditionally
# so checkout behavior is identical on every machine from now on.
*.sql text eol=lf
